// .patch = GON PatchMerge: a per-field suffix picks the policy (.overwrite .append .merge .add .multiply).
// faction.overwrite is observable through the dump's faction; the two numeric policies through the harness's
// `expect gon` (the merged entry the game holds at Character+0x240: health 6 -> 12, speed 5 -> 15) and the units
// event's hp / speed (tests/numeric.mewtest vs tests/numeric-vanilla.mewtest; docs/data-mods.md "Test-only overlays").
Pooter {
    properties {
        faction.overwrite allies
        health.multiply 2
    }
    stats {
        speed.add 10
    }
}
